<SiteLayout title="About Swoovr" description="A connection means something different to everyone. We’re building Swoovr to make those differences easier to understand, and easier to respect." eyebrow="The idea behind Swoovr" heading="More room for your kind of people." intro="A connection means something different to everyone. We’re building Swoovr to make those differences easier to understand, and easier to respect.">
<section class="editorial-split"><h2>Start with what<br />you actually want.</h2><div><p>A relationship. New friends. A conversation that turns into a plan. Whatever brings you here, you deserve space to be clear about it.</p><p>Swoovr is a dating and social discovery app for adults 18 and over, being developed by RePass Cloud in South Australia. Our focus is deliberate connection: people understanding each other’s intentions before deciding to get closer.</p><p>We’re starting in Adelaide. A useful local community matters more to us than a big number on a signup counter.</p></div></section><section class="editorial-split"><h2>Different intentions.<br />Equal respect.</h2><div><p>Our product brief includes friendship, dating, relationships, conversation and consensual casual connections. No one’s age, gender or orientation should be treated as a shortcut to guessing what they want.</p><p>We’re designing one core profile with different discovery contexts, so a friendship conversation doesn’t have to carry romantic expectations. The goal is to let people express both what they welcome and what they don’t.</p><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works/">Explore the approach ↗</a></div></section><section class="callout"><p class="eyebrow">Built with the community</p><h2>The people who use it<br />should help shape it.</h2><p>We’re inviting adults to share their experiences and help test the details, from the language on a profile to the choices around a first meeting.</p><a class="button" href="/beta/">Join the beta community</a></section>
</SiteLayout>
